OL,3,GNEWSA'We have to pay service charge to
OL,4,Alive near lake - what is it spent on?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of residents are refusing to
OL,7,Fpay a service charge to maintain a lake
OL,8,Fdue to what they believe is a lack of
OL,9,Ftransparency over how the money is
OL,10,Fspent.
OL,12,FMany householders and businesses in the
OL,13,FLakeside area of Doncaster are subject
OL,14,Fto the levy, which Doncaster Council
OL,15,Fsaid funds the upkeep of the area.
OL,17,FResidents agreed to the levy, which is
OL,18,Fin addition to their council tax, when
OL,19,Fthey bought their homes, but are
OL,20,Fcalling on the council to disclose what
OL,21,Fit covers.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
