OL,3,GNEWSA'We have to pay service charge to
OL,4,Alive near lake - what is it spent on?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteven Webster also feels those who are
OL,7,Fsubject to the charge are "paying for
OL,8,Feveryone to use the lake", which is a
OL,9,Fpublic recreation area.
